te a return for regular-priced items.\\n<br><br>\\nReturned items must be in their original condition – unworn, unwashed, undamaged, with original tags attached. Include the original packing slip.\\n<br><br>\\nTo initiate a return, please use our <strong>online return portal</strong>.\\n<br><br>\\n<strong>Items Not Eligible for Return/Refund:</strong>\\n<br><br>\\nCertain items cannot be returned or refunded, including undergarments.\\n<br><br>\\n<strong>Sale Items:</strong>\\n<br>\\nAll sale and promotional items are final sale. We cannot offer refunds, exchanges, or credits on discounted items, including BOGO items and those purchased during special sale events.\\n<br><br>\\nAny returned sale/ final items will be donated to a local charity.\\n<br><br>\\n<strong>Refund Method:</strong>\\n<br>\\nRefunds will be processed to the original payment method or, if requested, issued as a Shepherd’s Fashions gift card.\\n<br><br>\\n<strong>Damaged or Defective Items:</strong>\\n<br>\\nIf you receive an item that is damaged or defective, please contact us prior to initiating a return. We are here to assist you in resolving any issues and ensuring your satisfaction.\\n<br><br>\\n<strong>Return Process:</strong>\\n<br>\\nWhile return shipping fees are the responsibility of the customer, all returns must be processed through our RETURN PORTAL. This helps us efficiently manage the return process.\\n<br><br>\\nPlease be aware that you will need to manually ship your parcel back to us. We cannot provide a pre-paid shipping label.  \\n<br><br>\\n<strong>Contact Information:</strong>\\n<br>\\nIf you have any questions or concerns, feel free to connect with us via email at online@shepherdsfashions.com or by calling Customer Service at 613-789-7400 (ext. 214).\\n<br><br>\\nWe appreciate your understanding and cooperation. Your satisfaction is our priority!\",\"style\":{\"data\":{\"h1_typography\":{\"data\":{\"_inherit\":\"typography.heading\"},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"},\"strong_typography\":{\"data\":{\"_inherit\":\"typography.heading\",\"fontSize\":14,\"lineHeight\":21},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"},\"layout\":{\"data\":{\"container\":\"PRDescWrapper1\"},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableRecord\",\"__serializedRef__\":4},\"namespace\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"analytics\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"animations\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"_modelStyles\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"_cachedModel\":{\"data\":{\"namespace\":{\"namespace\":[\"tile10\"],\"pluginId\":\"richText1\"},\"value\":\"Html Mark up\",\"pageKey\":\"Product-X3KQp2JDqEHihAdJ_Pc9t\",\"pluginType\":\"RichTextWidget\",\"id\":\"tile10::richText1\"},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableRecord\",\"__serializedRef__\":0},\"container1img\":{\"data\":{\"id\":\"container1img\",\"type\":\"widget\",\"subtype\":\"ContainerWidget\",\"config\":{\"data\":{\"isTappable\":false,\"keyboardAware\":false,\"detectVisibility\":false,\"enableHaptics\":false,\"hapticMethod\":\"\",\"style\":{\"data\":{\"marginRight\":\"12\"},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"},\"layout\":{\"data\":{\"container\":\"TitleCont1\",\"hidden\":true,\"flex\":1,\"flexDirection\":\"column\"},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableRecord\",\"__serializedRef__\":4},\"namespace\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"analytics\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"animations\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"_modelStyles\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"_cachedModel\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableRecord\",\"__serializedRef__\":0},\"image13\":{\"data\":{\"id\":\"image13\",\"type\":\"widget\",\"subtype\":\"ImageWidget\",\"config\":{\"data\":{\"value\":\"\",\"resizeMode\":\"contain\",\"sourceType\":\"upload\",\