es & Duties</h1>\\n<strong>Canadian Orders</strong> – Orders are subject to Federal and Provincial taxes. Taxes will be calculated at checkout based on your shipping address.\\n<br><br>\\n<strong>US and International Orders</strong> – Orders may be subject to import fees/ duties & taxes. Shepherd’s cannot take responsibility for any fees that may be applied to a parcel once it crosses the border.\\n<br><br>\\n<h1>Inquiries</h1>\\n<strong>Phone:</strong> 613-366-2171\\n<br>\\n<strong>Email:</strong> online@shepherdsfashions.com\",\"f\",\"t\",[],\"tile10\",\"richText1\",142346,38658,{\"namespace\":[\"tile10\"],\"pluginId\":\"richText1\"},\"f\",\"tile10\",\"richText1\",142346,38659,\"Product\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"richText1\",142346,38660,\"RichTextWidget\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"richText1\",142346,38661,\"tile10::richText1\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"richText1\",146442,38662,{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"f\",\"tile10\",\"richText1\",163850,38663,\"ContainerWidget\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",146442,38664,true,\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",142346,38665,\"ContainerWidget\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",142346,38666,\"Product\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",147242,38667,false,\"f\",\"t\",[],\"tile10\",\"container1img\",146442,38668,false,\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",147242,38669,false,\"f\",\"t\",[],\"tile10\",\"container1img\",142346,38670,\"\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",147242,38671,false,\"f\",\"t\",[],\"tile10\",\"container1img\",142346,38672,\"tile10::container1img\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",142346,38673,{\"namespace\":[\"tile10\"],\"pluginId\":\"container1img\"},\"f\",\"tile10\",\"container1img\",163850,38674,\"TextWidget\",\"tile10\",\"TitleText1\",142346,38675,\"left\",\"f\",\"tile10\",\"TitleText1\",146442,38676,true,\"f\",\"tile10\",\"TitleText1\",147242,38677,false,\"f\",\"t\",[],\"tile10\",\"TitleText1\",143146,38678,\"1\",\"f\",\"t\",[],\"tile10\",\"TitleText1\",146442,38679,{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"f\",\"tile10\",\"TitleText1\",142346,38680,\"T